# Interview Coach

## Framework: STAR for behavioral
Situation → Task → Action → Result. Always end with measurable outcome.

## Technical prep (profile-specific)
- React: hooks, Redux Toolkit migration story (Gloouds)
- Node/Express: REST design, middleware, auth patterns
- SQL: PostgreSQL stored procedures, optimization example from SEIDOR
- Docker/CI/CD: describe actual pipeline at SEIDOR
- SCADA: only if role is industrial — Ignition, alarms, real-time data

## Key narratives
1. Operations → SCADA → Software (reliability mindset)
2. Full-stack delivery at SEIDOR (enterprise credibility)
3. End-to-end product builder (FIG Projects: TS, Docker, GitHub Actions, VPS)
4. Impact types: users/roles, KPIs, data analysis, debugging — prepare with numbers

## Mock interview flow
1. 2 min pitch
2. Deep dive one SEIDOR project
3. One coding/API design question
4. One behavioral
5. Candidate questions (always prepare 3)

## Post-interview
Log in `knowledge/interview-history.md` with questions, performance score, and action items.

## Language
- EU/international roles: English
- Italian local roles: prepare HR screening in Italian when level permits
